  "details": "On PCVR, using the quest link it takes 45ish seconds before any menu opens, and then .2 seconds to login. After the homeworld loads, if there's a video player it takes around 4-8 minutes before the video loads.\n\nOn quest standalone, everything is very fast to load, and works like I would expect.\n\nThis issue is present on my laptop and my desktop using meta quest link, but is not present when using the headset in quest standalone.\n\nI have scoured about 30 different threads looking for solutions, some reinstalling vrchat, some doing cache clearing, opening ports in firewalls. The only thing I haven't done is reinstall windows.\n\nI'm showing up here because I'm about to sell my Quest 3 and quit VRchat.",
